Summary
=======

Problem:
STP startup delay caused slow device connectivity.

Solution:
PortFast allows access ports to immediately enter the Forwarding State.

Benefit:
Faster network access while maintaining security through BPDU Guard.

Limitation:
Must not be used on switch-to-switch links.

